{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_F506C058","title":"Ava Decision Time","entry":"Dlg_F506C058::entry","exit":"Dlg_F506C058::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_CE4753F1","articyId":"72057619807789626","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I sense you'd like to say something about your impending decision with Mica.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I sense you'd like to say something about your impending decision with Mica.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":75.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48298","byteOffset":32607936,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_05817743","articyId":"72057619807789655","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"A fair response. Might I offer one suggestion?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A fair response. Might I offer one suggestion?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33721","byteOffset":20641656,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_9947BBDB","articyId":"72057619807789685","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"There's some truths that need to be uncovered here. I'd be happy to look into a few things with Banor, find out what is really at stake and where the evidence lies.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There's some truths that need to be uncovered here. I'd be happy to look into a few things with Banor, find out what is really at stake and where the evidence lies.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23102","byteOffset":16625288,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_140BBF07","articyId":"72057619807789707","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I think we have a very short amount of time to figure that out...","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think we have a very short amount of time to figure that out...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1925.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52122","byteOffset":34133440,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_A5DB1243","articyId":"72057619807790229","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I'm not sure. Banor would certainly know.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not sure. Banor would certainly know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":925.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25195","byteOffset":17413536,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_DAFB9C75","articyId":"72057606922846583","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Hang on, just receiving a message from Edison...","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hang on, just receiving a message from Edison...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2225.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19839","byteOffset":15388496,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_8E9E63DF","articyId":"72057619807789631","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Not right now. I have to think.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not right now. I have to think.","TextSheVersion":"Not right now. I have to think.","TextTheyVersion":"Not right now. I have to think."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":400.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29331","byteOffset":18977200,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_ABBAE7D2","articyId":"72057619807789639","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Nothing to do but talk with Edison.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nothing to do but talk with Edison.","TextSheVersion":"Nothing to do but talk with Edison.","TextTheyVersion":"Nothing to do but talk with Edison."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":400.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30579","byteOffset":19448488,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_510063F2","articyId":"72057619807789644","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yeah, any thoughts?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, any thoughts?","TextSheVersion":"Yeah, any thoughts?","TextTheyVersion":"Yeah, any thoughts?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":400.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46357","byteOffset":31870808,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_A264573F","articyId":"72057619807789669","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure.","TextSheVersion":"Sure.","TextTheyVersion":"Sure."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1012.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19104","byteOffset":15113400,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_03F4A217","articyId":"72057619807789693","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You think there's more to Edison's story?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You think there's more to Edison's story?","TextSheVersion":"You think there's more to Edison's story?","TextTheyVersion":"You think there's more to Edison's story?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1612.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20981","byteOffset":15819768,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_A7894E42","articyId":"72057619807789699","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You think Mica's full of it?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You think Mica's full of it?","TextSheVersion":"You think Mica's full of it?","TextTheyVersion":"You think Mica's full of it?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1612.0,"y":1000.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23478","byteOffset":16761336,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_A20EEC69","articyId":"72057619807790122","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"Hey, heard you had a run-in with one of our friends. These assholes will stop at nothing. The top two Corps in this city could feed and house every kid in the city a thousand times over.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, heard you had a run-in with one of our friends. These assholes will stop at nothing. The top two Corps in this city could feed and house every kid in the city a thousand times over.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36990","byteOffset":28336464,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_1CD9BB59","articyId":"72057667052375003","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"But they're too busy engaging in corporate warfare and bribing each other. Bastards would rather feed a hundred kids into a grinder than give up on 0.1% of their hourly profit.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But they're too busy engaging in corporate warfare and bribing each other. Bastards would rather feed a hundred kids into a grinder than give up on 0.1% of their hourly profit.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52515","byteOffset":34280472,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_D5F4AA71","articyId":"72057667052375010","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Edison Mattix","text":"*throat clearing*\r\n\r\nDamn, I need to calm down... Can you grab a six of Windopane lager? I'm hiding out at Conland Containers. I sent a Nav Point to your Automata. Later.","speakerId":"Ntt_5057514D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"*throat clearing*\r\n\r\nDamn, I need to calm down... Can you grab a six of Windopane lager? I'm hiding out at Conland Containers. I sent a Nav Point to your Automata. Later.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28522","byteOffset":18673936,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_3490A097","articyId":"72057619807790220","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Where can I find Windowpane Lager?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Where can I find Windowpane Lager?","TextSheVersion":"Where can I find Windowpane Lager?","TextTheyVersion":"Where can I find Windowpane Lager?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":